[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602043614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113445#issuecomment-3602043614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113445","id":3602043614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WstLe","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T13:24:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T13:24:07Z","body":"Possibly a regression from #112506 (didn't test), CC @RandomShaper.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602043614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604511102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113445#issuecomment-3604511102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113445","id":3604511102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W2Hl-","user":{"login":"brycehutchings","id":5100250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings","html_url":"https://github.com/brycehutchings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T00:31:13Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T00:34:48Z","body":"I spent a while digging into this and found the issue is indeed from #112506. The problem is that `cmd_backup` in that change is being used to invoke the callback, but that invocation uses std::move which mutates the objects.  In this specific case, the glow effects use Vector<float> argument which has ref counting that gets thrown off by this. The std::move causes the `cmd_backup` ref count to reach 0 and reset the Vector<float>, but then later `cmd->~CommandBase();` is executed and that original/real copy of the command (which is unmutated and thus unaware that the memory has already been freed) and frees it again. Or at least it is roughly like this.\n\nThis (seems hacky?) works around the problem for me and might explain the problem better:\n<img width=\"896\" height=\"770\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93b25099-0e69-40eb-bcbe-c166f76cdb15\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604511102/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604574831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113445#issuecomment-3604574831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113445","id":3604574831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W2XJv","user":{"login":"brycehutchings","id":5100250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings","html_url":"https://github.com/brycehutchings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T01:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T01:11:42Z","body":"Since the command buffer contains types which are not trivially copyable / POD types, this change to use memcpy doesn't look safe/correct to me. I think we'd have to change command buffer to enforce POD types for this to be safe.\n\nEDIT: It might be possible to solve this by adding a virtual \"move_to\" method to CommandBase so it can move into the temporary buffer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604574831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]